msgid "You are currently using WordPress version %s. Please be informed, that future versions of the WP Social Blogroll plugin will no longer support this version of WordPress. I recommend to upgrade your WordPress-installation to <a href=\"http://wordpress.org\">the latest version</a>."
msgstr "Du bruger WordPress version %s. Du skal vide, at fremtidige versioner af WP Social Blogroll-pluginnet ikke længere vil understøtte denne version af WordPress. Jeg anbefaler, at du opgraderer din WordPress-installation til <a href=\"http://da.wordpress.org\">den nyeste danske version</a>."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:589
